cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: ParaQeet  -  A quantum optimal control toolkit with simple parameter management
type: software
version: v0.11.1
abstract: >-
  ParaQeet is a python library for pulse level simulation of quantum dynamics,
  and optimization of pulse and model parameters using gradient-based and gradient-free
  optimization methods. Its codebase is built on a modular and differentiable architecture
  using JAX to combine analytical gradients with automatic differentiation for efficiency.
